				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12292341/i-hope-this-isn-t-just-a-dream#post-4337272</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 22 Aug 2019 06:20:28 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>UraniumEmpire</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1613974</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I have a very particular set of expectations when reading creepypasta: it has to be unnerving, it has to feel home-made, and it has to pose a question I can't answer. For the first two posts, I was sure this wasn't it.</p> <p>Then the final post hit me with the question, and I felt it. I felt that sort of frenzied determination of the theoretical person who'd write this, felt them reaching through the fourth wall (metaphorically speaking :p), felt the panic at the existential crises of being. This is one of those pastas that's gonna stick with me, I think.</p> <p>+1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
