						 <p>I'm jumping on the Parawatch bandwagon too!</p> <p>I've been wanting to write about DMT &amp; the machine elves for a while, and Parawatch gave me just the platform I needed. I actually found myself feeling really existential after writing this.</p> <p>Side note, but a lot of the names mentioned are real people. That quote? A real person said that. Seriously, DMT is wack.</p> <p>Also you may have noticed that I posted this before and deleted like ten minutes after&#8230; Well, this has a lot of new stuff and fix-ups, so give it another read before upvoting/downvoting. UwU</p> <p>Big thanks to my critters and beta readers:</p> <ul> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/laneous" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4894577&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1565393208" alt="Laneous" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4894577)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/laneous" >Laneous</a></span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossileiner" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2199269&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1565393208" alt="YossiLeiner" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2199269)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossileiner" >YossiLeiner</a></span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/natvoltaic" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2800867&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1565393208" alt="NatVoltaic" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2800867)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/natvoltaic" >NatVoltaic</a></span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?user